flowchart LR
    subgraph DUTY["Segregation of Duties — no agent confirms its own work"]
        direction LR
        RES["📚 Researcher<br/>proposes gap<br/>+ citation"] -->|"claim + paper + evidence"| VER["🛡️ Verifier<br/>(separate context)<br/>tries to DISPROVE"]
        VER -->|"APPROVED"| OK["ships to GAPS.md / issue"]
        VER -->|"REJECTED / UNCERTAIN"| OUT["excluded —<br/>logged, not hidden"]

        COD["💻 Coder<br/>writes the fix"] -->|"branch + diff"| TST["🧪 Tester<br/>runs tests"]
        TST -->|"pass"| PR["PR opened"]
        TST -->|"fail"| COD
    end

    Note["Precision model (MATH §4):<br/>P(valid | APPROVED) = s·p₀ / (s·p₀ + (1−c)(1−p₀)) ≈ 0.98<br/>at verifier specificity c→0.97"] -.-> DUTY

